{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"the-night-the-lights-went-out","version":1,"title":"The Night the Lights Went Out","ageTiers":["7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"One evening, the lights in Lartekor’s house went out. Click! The fridge stopped humming. The fan stopped turning. It was dark. ‘Auntie!’ he called. ‘I cannot see anything!’","sentences":["One evening, the lights in Lartekor’s house went out.","Click!","The fridge stopped humming.","The fan stopped turning.","It was dark.","‘Auntie!’ he called.","‘I cannot see anything!’"],"alt":"A boy stands in a dark room clutching a pillow as the lights go out.","image":{"hash":"sha256:667333fb3033b9642589bd1cff02656bc2733f0961ccadedf16c17c1b9e8aa56","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:fd4406e3507d46ad2a7273cc938c098929f696ff85e199a8bd8ac466fb7a560c","durationMs":19680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5822],[5822,6842],[6842,10101],[10101,12987],[12987,14505],[14505,17043],[17043,19680]],"words":[[0,373],[373,1443],[1443,1816],[1816,2563],[2563,2811],[2811,3931],[3931,4553],[4553,5051],[5051,5822],[5822,6842],[6842,7215],[7215,7962],[7962,8832],[8832,10101],[10101,10474],[10474,10848],[10848,11718],[11718,12987],[12987,13236],[13236,13609],[13609,14505],[14505,15649],[15649,15898],[15898,17043],[17043,17167],[17167,17914],[17914,18287],[18287,19680]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Auntie Efia found her torch. Click! A circle of yellow light shone on the floor. ‘Here I am,’ she said. ‘Do not be afraid. It is only a power cut.’","sentences":["Auntie Efia found her torch.","Click!","A circle of yellow light shone on the floor.","‘Here I am,’ she said.","‘Do not be afraid.","It is only a power cut.’"],"alt":"An aunt holds up a torch and a circle of light falls on the floor.","image":{"hash":"sha256:aae95ab1b58eae19f17df5da80b50fed90a997799f4abc4e8a5688902ccfc0a9","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:4766aa9834e529774b18e6211def37dfbccc0ac3b04e560c982dc22290379706","durationMs":14360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2944],[2944,3865],[3865,8158],[8158,10270],[10270,12090],[12090,14360]],"words":[[0,674],[674,1124],[1124,1685],[1685,2023],[2023,2944],[2944,3865],[3865,3978],[3978,4652],[4652,4877],[4877,5551],[5551,6113],[6113,6674],[6674,6899],[6899,7236],[7236,8158],[8158,8607],[8607,8719],[8719,9124],[9124,9461],[9461,10270],[10270,10495],[10495,10832],[10832,11057],[11057,12090],[12090,12315],[12315,12540],[12540,12989],[12989,13102],[13102,13663],[13663,14360]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"She held her hand in front of the light. On the wall, a shadow dog appeared. Then a bird. Then a rabbit. Lartekor giggled. ‘Do it again!’ he said.","sentences":["She held her hand in front of the light.","On the wall, a shadow dog appeared.","Then a bird.","Then a rabbit.","Lartekor giggled.","‘Do it again!’ he said."],"alt":"Hand shadows of a dog, a bird and a rabbit appear on a wall in torchlight.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d291d873ea7ff6ced6a72757b77bff3bfd51f92738a92700f5c1a903c41c08b9","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d82c0d86b6d418520a3ca68bea70543b98a0a58cb579b848397a7c2c6f70f5fc","durationMs":17560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4550],[4550,8780],[8780,10403],[10403,12292],[12292,14713],[14713,17560]],"words":[[0,399],[399,931],[931,1330],[1330,1862],[1862,2128],[2128,2794],[2794,3060],[3060,3459],[3459,4550],[4550,4816],[4816,5215],[5215,5960],[5960,6093],[6093,6891],[6891,7290],[7290,8780],[8780,9312],[9312,9445],[9445,10403],[10403,10935],[10935,11068],[11068,12292],[12292,13356],[13356,14713],[14713,14979],[14979,15245],[15245,16336],[16336,16602],[16602,17560]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"‘A shadow is made when something blocks the light,’ said Auntie Efia. ‘My hand blocks the torch, so there is a dark shape on the wall.’ Lartekor tried it with his own hand.","sentences":["‘A shadow is made when something blocks the light,’ said Auntie Efia.","‘My hand blocks the torch, so there is a dark shape on the wall.’ Lartekor tried it with his own hand."],"alt":"A boy makes a shadow on the wall with his own hand.","image":{"hash":"sha256:75a635c69d943ee5027bfd60fd00f62681d6bc616239bcea9e0cc53066a9aa26","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:49581b8201307fe70aac8d607dd72a9dd6b1dc2c3aa1d40fb0b46516440b73ec","durationMs":14320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5855],[5855,14320]],"words":[[0,100],[100,697],[697,896],[896,1295],[1295,1693],[1693,2589],[2589,3187],[3187,3485],[3485,4143],[4143,4541],[4541,5138],[5138,5855],[5855,6055],[6055,6453],[6453,7050],[7050,7349],[7349,8006],[8006,8206],[8206,8704],[8704,8903],[8903,9002],[9002,9401],[9401,9899],[9899,10098],[10098,10396],[10396,11113],[11113,11910],[11910,12408],[12408,12607],[12607,13006],[13006,13304],[13304,13603],[13603,14320]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"‘Should we light a candle?’ asked Lartekor. ‘No,’ said Auntie Efia. ‘Never play with matches or candles. Fire can hurt people and burn a house. A torch is safer. Always ask a grown-up.’","sentences":["‘Should we light a candle?’ asked Lartekor.","‘No,’ said Auntie Efia.","‘Never play with matches or candles.","Fire can hurt people and burn a house.","A torch is safer.","Always ask a grown-up.’"],"alt":"An aunt shakes her head and points to a torch rather than a candle.","image":{"hash":"sha256:8eac89091b96760930d80f667daf23dfbe4def6634184857e52ebfc1e8189880","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:c7cd1b4f13d038608fcb7acd05739d3eee1d43e2523c0002e83f4a0505ac104a","durationMs":18360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4465],[4465,6823],[6823,10472],[10472,14235],[14235,16071],[16071,18360]],"words":[[0,680],[680,907],[907,1473],[1473,1587],[1587,2629],[2629,3196],[3196,4465],[4465,4873],[4873,5327],[5327,6007],[6007,6823],[6823,7389],[7389,7843],[7843,8296],[8296,9089],[9089,9316],[9316,10472],[10472,10925],[10925,11265],[11265,11719],[11719,12399],[12399,12739],[12739,13192],[13192,13305],[13305,14235],[14235,14348],[14348,14915],[14915,15141],[15141,16071],[16071,16751],[16751,17091],[17091,17204],[17204,18360]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Then Auntie Efia took his hand. They went outside, to the yard. ‘Look up,’ she said. Lartekor looked up and gasped. The sky was full of stars!","sentences":["Then Auntie Efia took his hand.","They went outside, to the yard.","‘Look up,’ she said.","Lartekor looked up and gasped.","The sky was full of stars!"],"alt":"A boy and his aunt stand in the yard looking up at a sky full of stars.","image":{"hash":"sha256:141607e871e64d8ccb5f30f571917e8b67c7b4e16c22908b17082ee96263194e","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:41d3db2c7584046e3aabe907ea2259e9e59e35554c67cba845ab534c01da9c8e","durationMs":19400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4335],[4335,8762],[8762,11499],[11499,15834],[15834,19400]],"words":[[0,615],[615,1537],[1537,2152],[2152,2767],[2767,3228],[3228,4335],[4335,4950],[4950,5565],[5565,6887],[6887,7194],[7194,7655],[7655,8762],[8762,9377],[9377,9931],[9931,10392],[10392,11499],[11499,12728],[12728,13651],[13651,13958],[13958,14419],[14419,15834],[15834,16295],[16295,16756],[16756,17217],[17217,17832],[17832,18139],[18139,19400]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"‘Why can I see so many?’ he asked. ‘When the street lights and house lights are on, their glow hides the stars,’ said Auntie Efia. ‘Tonight there is less light, so we can see more.’","sentences":["‘Why can I see so many?’ he asked.","‘When the street lights and house lights are on, their glow hides the stars,’ said Auntie Efia.","‘Tonight there is less light, so we can see more.’"],"alt":"A boy and his aunt point at the stars with the town dark below.","image":{"hash":"sha256:e7f62ef190c546ceae11e02669cfd45f818b96a66314e646d0d6a8adfbb6cca6","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:46d89e2701ee8089a4123c17ac5d631f1275a8f570396209ba815e285c346bea","durationMs":15560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3018],[3018,11270],[11270,15560]],"words":[[0,308],[308,616],[616,718],[718,1026],[1026,1232],[1232,1971],[1971,2176],[2176,3018],[3018,3428],[3428,3736],[3736,4352],[4352,4968],[4968,5276],[5276,5789],[5789,6405],[6405,6713],[6713,7082],[7082,7595],[7595,8006],[8006,8519],[8519,8827],[8827,9504],[9504,9915],[9915,10531],[10531,11270],[11270,11988],[11988,12501],[12501,12707],[12707,13117],[13117,13795],[13795,14000],[14000,14205],[14205,14513],[14513,14821],[14821,15560]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"They sat and counted stars until the lights came back on. Click! The fan began to turn. ‘I was not scared after all,’ said Lartekor. The end.","sentences":["They sat and counted stars until the lights came back on.","Click!","The fan began to turn.","‘I was not scared after all,’ said Lartekor.","The end."],"alt":"A boy and his aunt sit on a mat counting stars as the house lights come back.","image":{"hash":"sha256:1a9b88f983e413446c0bc9875764b3e45868302cabc753fff3e56a6dba403b2a","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:2e611c159a80662882b86936a500efbc21a63fa4bb8e98bbadb7f98dbe285063","durationMs":16320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6444],[6444,7518],[7518,10164],[10164,15115],[15115,16320]],"words":[[0,524],[524,917],[917,1310],[1310,2227],[2227,2882],[2882,3536],[3536,3929],[3929,4715],[4715,5239],[5239,5763],[5763,6444],[6444,7518],[7518,7911],[7911,8304],[8304,8959],[8959,9221],[9221,10164],[10164,10295],[10295,10688],[10688,11081],[11081,11867],[11867,12522],[12522,13124],[13124,13648],[13648,15115],[15115,15508],[15508,16320]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"lights-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":4,"question":"What is a shadow, says Auntie Efia?","options":["A dark shape made when something blocks light","A kind of torch","A kind of star"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"lights-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":5,"question":"What is safer in a power cut?","options":["A torch","A candle","Matches"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"lights-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":6,"targetSound":"st","prompt":"Which words start with the st sound, like stars?","options":["stars","sky","stopped","street"],"correctIndexes":[0,2,3]},{"id":"lights-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":6,"prompt":"The lights are off. Why might the stars look brighter? Tell a friend.","options":["Less light hides them","The stars come closer"]},{"id":"lights-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["The lights went out.","Auntie Efia made shadow animals.","They looked at the stars.","The lights came back on."]},{"id":"lights-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Lartekor was scared and then amazed. How do you feel in the dark?","feelingOptions":["Scared","Curious","Calm","Amazed"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"torch","definition":"A small light that you hold in your hand and that runs on batteries.","pages":[2,5]},{"word":"shadow","definition":"A dark shape made when something blocks light.","pages":[3,4]},{"word":"stars","definition":"Bright points of light in the night sky.","pages":[6,7,8]}],"assets":{"sha256:667333fb3033b9642589bd1cff02656bc2733f0961ccadedf16c17c1b9e8aa56":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/the-night-the-lights-went-out/page1-1.webp","bytes":60046,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:fd4406e3507d46ad2a7273cc938c098929f696ff85e199a8bd8ac466fb7a560c":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/fd4406e3507d.mp3","bytes":158060,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:aae95ab1b58eae19f17df5da80b50fed90a997799f4abc4e8a5688902ccfc0a9":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/the-night-the-lights-went-out/page2-1.webp","bytes":70284,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:4766aa9834e529774b18e6211def37dfbccc0ac3b04e560c982dc22290379706":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/4766aa9834e5.mp3","bytes":115628,"type":"audio/mpe